\item[S2] Erickson, Martin, Sequence defined on multisets, Open Problem Garden, node 37226. Complete problem, discussion and bibliography (including mathematical image alt text). \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/a_sequence_defined_on_multisets}.
